# ISUZU Frontend Design System & UI/UX Standards

This rule enforces visual standards, color tokens, typography, and factory ergonomics for the ISUZU OT-CapEx manufacturing platform.

## 1. Color Palette & Semantic Tokens

- **Brand Primary Red**: `#cc0000` (`var(--primary)`). Use for primary buttons, active states, and brand badges.
  - Hover state: `#990000` / `#b30000`.
  - Subtle red: `bg-red-50 text-[#cc0000] border-red-200 dark:bg-red-950/40 dark:text-red-300 dark:border-red-900`.
- **Industrial Neutrals (Clean & Anti-Glare)**:
  - Background: `bg-background` (`#f8fafc` light / `#070b12` dark).
  - Surface/Card: `bg-card` (`#ffffff` light / `#0f172a` dark) with `border-border` (`#e2e8f0` light / `#1e293b` dark).
- **CapEx vs. OpEx Financial Segregation**:
  - **CapEx (Fixed Asset Capitalization)**: Sky blue `bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 border-sky-300 dark:bg-sky-950/60 dark:text-sky-300 dark:border-sky-800`.
  - **OpEx (Routine Production Overtime)**: Neutral slate `bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300`.
- **Burn Index (BBI) Status Colors**:
  - Safe (`BBI < 0.85`): Emerald `text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 dark:text-emerald-400 dark:bg-emerald-950/40`.
  - Caution (`0.85 <= BBI <= 1.00`): Amber `text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 dark:text-amber-400 dark:bg-amber-950/40`.
  - Critical / Deficit (`BBI > 1.00`): ISUZU Red `text-[#cc0000] bg-red-50 dark:text-red-400 dark:bg-red-950/40`.

## 2. Typography & Tabular Numbers

- Standard UI labels and headers use `Instrument Sans` (`font-sans`).
- **Mandatory Monospace / Tabular Alignment**: All Employee IDs (NIK), overtime hours, timestamps, and currency amounts **must** use tabular figures to prevent horizontal jitter during data updates.

```vue
<!-- ✅ GOOD: Monospace tabular alignment for audit figures -->
<span class="font-mono tabular-nums text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
    {{ formatRupiah(amount) }}
</span>
<span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">ISZ-4091</span>
<span class="font-mono tabular-nums text-sm font-bold text-red-600">02.5 Jam</span>

<!-- ❌ BAD: Variable width numerals causing table column misalignment -->
<span class="text-sm">{{ amount }}</span>
```

## 3. Indonesian Manufacturing Ergonomics & Guardrails

- **3-Click Max for Daily Shifts**: Team Leaders have only 10–15 minutes at shift-end. Overtime submission must require ≤ 3 clicks: (1) Select team/operator, (2) Adjust hours, (3) Submit.
- **Asynchronous Non-Blocking SPKL**: Physical paper SPKL with wet signatures has a 48-hour grace period. Shifts must not be stalled awaiting paperwork upload. Always show amber pill `Menunggu Fisik SPKL (Sisa X Jam)` during grace period.
- **Single Modal Depth (No Modal Stacking)**: Never open a modal inside another modal. Use slide-in `Sheet` (drawer) from right for detail/edit forms instead of stacked popups.
- **Strictly Wayfinder (No Ziggy)**: Never import or use `route()` from Ziggy. Always use `@/actions` or `@/routes` generated by Wayfinder.
- **Single Root Element**: All Vue components in `resources/js/` must have exactly one root element.
- **i18n Multilingual**: Never hardcode user strings in Vue templates. Use `__()` from `useTrans` with `lang/id.json` as default and `lang/en.json` fallback.
- **Regional Standards**: Timezone is `WIB (Asia/Jakarta)`, Currency is `Rupiah (Rp)`.

